  "reading": {
    "zh": "从十二个领域进入：运行时与生存系统驱动避难所日常，智能体带着心理、背包与制作能力参与社会、治理、经济与空间互动；观察者记录并实验，文明通过技术与遗物积累并重启。箭头表示依赖方向。",
    "en": "Enter through twelve domains: runtime and survival drive shelter life; agents with psyche, backpacks and crafting join social, political, economic and spatial life; the observer records and experiments; civilization accumulates and restarts through tech and relics. Arrows show dependency direction."
